/// {sent, duplicates} for client_id 'all', else the created notification and whether it was pushed
/// live. With a notification_id that already exists for the same device (integration retry after
/// the hub was unreachable): the existing notification, ws_sent false, duplicate true. For 'all'
/// with a broadcast notification_id the per-device ids are derived (UUIDv5, docs/protocol.md) and
/// devices that already have theirs count as duplicates (nothing created or pushed for them).
/// Watches have no hub connection: 'all' leaves them out, and a notification for one watch goes to
/// the phone that set it up (the notification's client_id is the phone's, the answer names it in
